coverage/
*.log

# Signing material. Nothing here is tracked today and nothing should be: an author certificate is
# permanent, unrecoverable and tied to the published application, and a distributor certificate
# carries the identifiers of the televisions it was issued for. The README tells every reader to
# create their own, so this is the guard for the one who creates it inside the checkout.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.cer
*.crt
*.key
profiles.xml
author-signature.xml
signature*.xml

# Vite reads .env.local and the mode specific variants too, which the single .env above missed.
.env*

# Coding agent scratch directories.
.claude/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
